The PEPS package provides a functional simulation of a PDP-8 system with various peripherals.  When compared to real-world hardware of various PDP-8 systems, the configuration is considered to be a large system. This provides much of the performance of the original PDP-8 systems while actually running on a Windows-based personal computer.\f0\par
